            "block_content": "School responsibilities beyond direct services, (i.e. staff meetings, conferences, back-to-school nights, and etc.) shall be agreed upon by the SERS person with multiple school assignments and their principals. If agreement cannot be reached, the appropriate Special Education Director will decide.",
